{title: PSALM 150}
{artist: UNITED VOICES CHOIR & ANTHONY BROWN}

{repeat: 2}
Let everything that hath breath praise the Lord, [×3]
For His mighty acts and His wondrous works,
Praise the Lord, praise the Lord, praise the Lord.

{repeat: 4}
We give Thee honour (Oh Lord we give Thee praise),
power and glory

{repeat: 3}
Everlasting Father Hosannah the Prince of peace
Alpha and Omega beginning and the ending

All praise the Lord
Amen [×9]
